lineage":"paternal"},"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line049","c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-053","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line049","quote":"元嘉五年，起為衡陽王義季征虜長史。義季年少，未親政，眾事一以委之。尋加南東海太守。入為司徒右長史，尚書吏部郎，司徒左長史，南東海太守。府公彭城王義康專覽政事，不欲自下厝懷，而登之性剛，每陳己意，義康甚不悅，出為吳郡太守。州郡相臨，執意無改，因其莅任贓貨，以事免官。弟炳之時為臨川內史，登之隨弟之郡，優游自適。俄而除豫章太守，便道之官。登之初至臨川，吏民咸相輕侮，豫章與臨川接境，郡又華大，儀迓光赫，土人並驚歎焉。十八年，遷江州刺史。疾篤，徵為中護軍，未拜。二十年，卒，時年六十二。即以為贈。"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-053","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051","quote":"子沖遠，太宗鎮姑孰，為衞軍長史，卒於豫章太守，追贈侍中。"}],"interpretation_note":"完整〈庾登之〉末段承前主語；不由年齡推父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_DDBAA","title":null,"surname":"庾","ming":"沖遠","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-053","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051","quote":"子沖遠，太宗鎮姑孰，為衞軍長史，卒於豫章太守，追贈侍中。","note":"同一完整庾氏傳文與已存近親辨識的省名承姓；冰段原稱庾氏之寶、登之傳首全稱庾登之提供家族語境。這是編輯拆分，非每段都明寫庾姓；不由承姓增補生父、同母或未見名字。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"references":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-073","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","source_id":"s-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao:line092","quote":"冰字季堅。兄亮以名德流訓，冰以雅素垂風，諸弟相率莫不好禮，為世論所重，亮常以為庾氏之寶。司徒辟，不就，征秘書郎。預討華軼功，封都鄉侯。王導請為司徒右長史，出補吳國內史。","scope":"editorial_surname_from_biographical_family_context","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=