,"last_line":49,"revision_id":1996685,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"text_layer":"received_chapter","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-053","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051","text":"子沖遠，太宗鎮姑孰，為衞軍長史，卒於豫章太守，追贈侍中。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"沖遠","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_DDBAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"太宗","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"作品為宋書，既有太宗候選為宋明帝；本句「鎮姑孰」具體任職證據尚待並核，先不只據廟號全域套用。","candidate_person_ids":["cti_o52_4nz"],"candidate_labels":["宋明帝彧"]}],"source_position":{"first_line":51,"last_line":51,"revision_id":1996685,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"text_layer":"received_chapter","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-053","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line066","text":"又曰：「臣見劉伯寵大慷慨炳之所行，云有人送張幼緒，幼緒語人，吾雖得一縣，負三十萬錢，庾沖遠乃當送至新林，見縛束，猶未得解手。荀萬秋嘗詣炳之，值一客姓夏侯，主人問：『有好牛不？』云：『無。』問：『有好馬不？』又云：『無。政有佳驢耳。』炳之便答：『甚是所欲。』客出門，遂與相聞索之。劉道錫云是炳之所舉，就道錫索嫁女具及祠器，乃當百萬數。猶謂不然。選令史章龍向臣說，亦歎其受納之過，言『實得嫁女具，銅鑪四人舉乃勝，細葛斗帳等物，不可稱數』。在尚書中，令奴酤酃酒，利其百十，亦是立臺閣所無，不審少簡聖聽不？恐仰傷日月之明，臣竊為之歎息。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"start":4,"end":5,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"d84_kqu_2g5","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line066:m0004"},{"start":6,"end":9,"surface":"劉伯寵","kind":"person","person_id":"1c5_5a9_3b5","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line066:m0006"},{"start":12,"end":14,"surface":"炳之","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_DDBB","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line066:m0012"},{"start":19,"end":20,"surface":"人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"送張幼緒